          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202503/bg2025032202.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>开源的 VS Code 插件，通过图标生成 flex、grid 布局的 CSS 代码。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/6347\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@xutao-o</a> 投稿）</p>",
